    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/93bbbe9b86a564840107613b7f337c95.avif?t=1685759770\" /></div><br><br>IKO 39 offers the player, along with the main character, engineer Casey, to go to the planet Morrow, which has stopped communicating with Earth.<br>Arriving on the planet we will face a number of problems:<br><br>- repair of the ship with the search for batteries to it;<br>- constant lack of oxygen;<br>- by the evil elements of the station, who are trying to kill us;<br>- sandstorms that interfere with visibility;<br>- you constantly have to take control of different station devices (drone and other elements);<br>- we will have to investigate what happened at the station with the help of holographic blocks of memories and diaries of the station manager.<br>- and other problems of the station that lie in wait for our heroine.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/29bb66fc9c3001a2264fc81f12cc1f78.poster.avif?t=1685759770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/29bb66fc9c3001a2264fc81f12cc1f78.webm?t=1685759770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/29bb66fc9c3001a2264fc81f12cc1f78.mp4?t=1685759770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>And in the end, we have to find out what happened at the IKO 39 station with its inhabitants.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/93bbbe9b86a564840107613b7f337c95.avif?t=1685759770\" /></div><br><br>IKO 39 offers the player, along with the main character, engineer Casey, to go to the planet Morrow, which has stopped communicating with Earth.<br>Arriving on the planet we will face a number of problems:<br><br>- repair of the ship with the search for batteries to it;<br>- constant lack of oxygen;<br>- by the evil elements of the station, who are trying to kill us;<br>- sandstorms that interfere with visibility;<br>- you constantly have to take control of different station devices (drone and other elements);<br>- we will have to investigate what happened at the station with the help of holographic blocks of memories and diaries of the station manager.<br>- and other problems of the station that lie in wait for our heroine.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/29bb66fc9c3001a2264fc81f12cc1f78.poster.avif?t=1685759770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/29bb66fc9c3001a2264fc81f12cc1f78.webm?t=1685759770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174270/extras/29bb66fc9c3001a2264fc81f12cc1f78.mp4?t=1685759770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>And in the end, we have to find out what happened at the IKO 39 station with its inhabitants.</strong>",
    "short_description": "Find out what happened at the station, which had lost contact with the Earth. EMI \u2013 the artificial intelligence of the station \u2013 will help you to solve the mystery. But be careful. You are not alone on the planet...",
